---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | AfriMigrate"
  description="AfriMigrate's privacy policy: what information we collect, how it's used, and your rights as a user of our free migration planning tools."
>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy Policy</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">Last updated: September 2026</p>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">AfriMigrate ("we", "us") operates afrimigrate.com, a free migration planning website for Africans moving abroad.</p>

    <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 1rem;">We collect information you provide directly, such as your email address when you join our waitlist, and information entered into our calculator and checklist tools (which run through our partner platform Bubble) to generate your personalised results.</p>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">We may also collect standard technical data (browser type, pages visited) through basic analytics to understand how our tools are used.</p>

    <h2>3. How we use your information</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">We use your information to provide the tools you request, send you updates if you've joined our waitlist, and improve our site. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

    <h2>4. Third-party tools</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Our calculators are embedded from Bubble, a third-party application platform. Data you enter into these tools is processed according to Bubble's own privacy practices in addition to ours.</p>

    <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">You can ask us to access, correct or delete your personal information, or unsubscribe from our emails, at any time by contacting us through our Instagram, @afrimigrate.app.</p>

    <h2>6. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px;">We may update this policy as AfriMigrate grows. We'll post any changes here with a new "last updated" date.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="card">
      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink2);">This page is a general template and has not been reviewed by a lawyer. Before AfriMigrate handles real user data (waitlist signups, calculator inputs) at scale, this policy should be reviewed by a qualified professional to ensure it meets UK GDPR and any other applicable data protection requirements.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
